        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-dan (ko'ra)' bilan bir xil: 'avtobusDAN tez' = 버스보다 빨라요. 'Ko'proq' — 더, 'ancha' — 훨씬.",
      "compare_en": "Like English '…-er than': 'faster THAN the bus' = 버스보다 빨라요. Korean doesn't change the adjective — it adds 더 (more) if needed."
