        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '... qilishni bilaman' ga mos: 'mashina haydaSHNI BILAMAN' = 운전할 줄 알아요. 'Bilmayman' — 줄 몰라요.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'know how to': 'I know how to drive' = 운전할 줄 알아요; 'don't know how to' = …-(으)ㄹ 줄 몰라요."
